Z||000004||BC-GT||04-10-2001||10:29 PM||||After checking a few tankfulls myself, I'm only getting 11-12 mpg myself. I'm really wondering if people are getiing 20+ mpgs and how there could be such a difference. After reading various threads it seems half of us are getting crappy mileage and the other half are great(wish I was on the great side <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">) My car runs fine and has given me no codes to date.<P>------------------<BR>Darryl Martin<BR>1985 GT <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.zing.com/picture/pf251a969c96964ef15691e97e7ac4489/feb64e3a.jpg.orig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
