Z||000011||Carrolles||04-11-2001||07:36 AM||||I have an 85SE v-6 4spd (I installed a Grooms 2.8 about a year and a half ago).  I drive around 50 mph to and from work (40 mile round trip) on a twisty mountain back road.  I do run around 80 on the highway and like to blast up the mountain at full throttle (poor mans dyno) whenever possible.  I consistantly get between 23 and 26 mpg.<P>I have an 85GT auto with a tired engine that gets between 18 abd 22 on the same route.||||reg||1
