Z||000018||862M4inCA||04-13-2001||06:06 AM||||hrm.....not a bad idea with the cop and dog, however I'd make sure the laws are different where you live or you are REAL good friends with that cop....Back when I lived in CA I knew someone who was cleaning up off drugs and asked probation if they could come in and check (since she didn't remember if she still had any hidden) and they said if they were to find any they would my law have to take her in for it. Needless to say she said nevermind. heh||||reg||1
